# Context filter for deploy/update/Dockerfile (BuildKit picks <Dockerfile>.dockerignore
# over the root .dockerignore). The root file drops **/*.md, which `cargo build -p wth`
# needs (crates/*/… are include_str!'d). Keep only build output and secrets out.
.git
.github
**/.DS_Store
target
**/target
**/node_modules
**/.bun
**/.vite
crates/desktop/ui/dist
crates/desktop/binaries
crates/desktop/gen
**/*.app
**/*.dmg
.env.signing
**/.env
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-*
**/*.log
